    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are numbers to call but it doesn't change the reality of it. nothing actually changes. i'm just exhausted. like, physically and mentally i'm just empty. it feels like i'm just running on a treadmill that's going way too fast and i'm about to fall off. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to sleep and not have to deal with any of this anymore.",
